  "name": "Frozen Beef Stew",
  "subtitle": "A hearty pressure-cooked stew with tender vegetables",
  "description": "Frozen beef and vegetables cook with herbs, broth, and wine, then finish with a quick cornstarch slurry for a thick, savory stew.",
